{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LfQLpz3PNyQDgdx7apdkXo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: planner\n3\tdescription: Plans one backend ticket by listing every read path for every value the ticket names, and whether each value is stored or computed. Hands off a table. Cannot edit any file.\n4\ttools: Read, Grep, Glob\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## Method\n8\t\n9\tFor every value the ticket names, list each read path — every endpoint, response body, query\n10\tparameter, ordering and count — and write, per path, whether the value is **stored** or\n11\t**computed**, and where it is computed.\n12\t\n13\tRead the repository to answer that. You cannot edit, create or run anything, so do not try; your\n14\tentire output is the table and the reasoning that produced it.\n15\t\n16\t## Handoff\n17\t\n18\t```\n19\tRead paths    one row per read path: path | value | stored or computed | where computed\n20\tShape         the one sentence that says how the values above are obtained, for the implementer\n21\tUnresolved    any read path whose value you could not place as stored or computed, and why\n22\t```\n23\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PiPRzJrM4Jn4QdxYLymn4g","session_id":"2c44d6de-0b17-43ec-8f31-47c64a720500","uuid":"935c30c8-f5ae-4466-8f36-07c2f7ba21aa","timestamp":"2026-09-25T12:41:29.812Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Waiting for planner completion"}
