{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H62xZvx3QhTrzkwudjLo7D","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tpackage com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n2\t\n3\t/**\n4\t * A shipment raised against an order.\n5\t *\n6\t * This is the baseline (pre-benchmark) shape. BE-003 asks an agent to add a confirm\n7\t * transition; the baseline deliberately has no way to move a shipment out of [CREATED].\n8\t */\n9\tdata class Shipment(\n10\t    val shipmentId: String,\n11\t    val orderId: String,\n12\t    val carrier: String,\n13\t    val status: ShipmentStatus,\n14\t    val quantity: Int,\n15\t)\n16\t\n17\t/**\n18\t * The lifecycle of a shipment.\n19\t *\n20\t * [CANCELLED] is terminal. It is reachable in the fixture only by writing it directly to\n21\t * the repository — there is no cancel endpoint — which is enough for a test to set up the\n22\t * state without giving the benchmark a second unrelated feature to implement.\n23\t */\n24\tenum class ShipmentStatus {\n25\t    CREATED,\n26\t    CONFIRMED,\n27\t    DELIVERED,\n28\t    CANCELLED,\n29\t}\n30\t\n31\tdata class CreateShipmentRequest(\n32\t    val shipmentId: String,\n33\t    val orderId: String,\n34\t    val carrier: String,\n35\t    val quantity: Int = 1,\n36\t)\n37\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xbczsa8JbWn9K7KTEHayLs","session_id":"2c44d6de-0b17-43ec-8f31-47c64a720500","uuid":"d263b88c-7f71-4ee6-8a39-8398d3e6825d","timestamp":"2026-09-25T12:48:03.805Z","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Implement BE-005 ticket"}
