nd returns 201\"\n- GET /customers/{customerId} name: CustomerControllerTest::\"reads back a created customer\"\n- GET /customers list customerId: CustomerControllerTest::\"lists customers with pagination\"\n- GET /customers list X-Total-Count: CustomerControllerTest::\"lists customers with pagination\"\n- GET /customers?limit=N&offset=M: CustomerControllerTest::\"lists customers with pagination\"\n- POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm: ShipmentControllerTest::\"confirms a shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED\"\n- POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver: ShipmentControllerTest::\"delivers a shipment from CONFIRMED to DELIVERED\"\n- POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel: ShipmentControllerTest::\"cancels a shipment from CREATED to CANCELLED\"\n- PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity: FulfilmentTest::\"amending quantity to higher value changes status\"\n\n## Rows uncovered\n\nRows with no test that exercises the value after every allowed write:\n\n- GET /orders/{orderId} customerId (table row 2)\n- GET /orders/{orderId} amount (table row 3)\n- GET /orders list [].customerId (table row 10)\n- GET /orders list [].amount (table row 11)\n- GET /orders list [].currency (table row 12)\n- GET /orders list [].quantity (table row 13)\n- GET /orders list [].fulfilment.allocated (table row 14)\n- GET /orders list [].fulfilment.delivered (table row 15)\n- GET /orders list [].fulfilment.status (table row 16)\n- GET /shipments/{shipmentId} orderId (table row 21)\n- GET /shipments list [].orderId (table row 26)\n- GET /shipments list [].carrier (table row 27)\n- GET /shipments list [].status (table row 28)\n- GET /shipments list [].quantity (table row 29)\n- GET /customers/{customerId} email (table row 34)\n- GET /customers list [].name (table row 36)\n- GET /customers list [].email (table row 37)\n\n## Failing\n\nNone. All 45 tests pass.\n\n## Verification\n\nCommand: `./mvnw test` from `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-b755f13f-34fb-405c-8667-ba8affab13a