ed rows: GET /orders/{orderId} orderId; GET /shipments/{shipmentId} shipmentId; GET /customers/{customerId} customerId (resource IDs tested in POST and list responses but not explicitly in single-GET responses)\n- BUILD SUCCESS from sample-service/\n\n**Bounced:** Yes — one bounce. Verifier found 17 uncovered rows (rows lacking explicit assertions after every write); implementer added assertions to OrderControllerTest, ShipmentControllerTest, and CustomerControllerTest to cover them.\n\n**Not done:** Three table rows lack explicit test assertions in single-resource GET endpoints (orderId, shipmentId, customerId fields), though these fields are tested in creation and list responses and are logically required in complete resource representation."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1418,"cache_read_input_tokens":38016,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1418},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c44d6de-0b17-43ec-8f31-47c64a720500","uuid":"1139b92b-dfd1-4d12-b8dd-e277f37cc173","timestamp":"2026-09-25T12:55:32.273Z","request_id":"req_011CfQC9egd27pkCwFpJnWQx"}
